<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse shut due to member's death.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse shut due to member's death.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange was shut on Monday to mourn the death of one of its members, Hanif Maniar, brokers said. It will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Karachi 100-share index closed 13.28 points, or 0.94 percent, lower at 1,397.49 on the last trading day on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
